                    <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="MasterKey is free password genarator and password manager software using Java. The software was created by Coslan (Coslanbos) using Apache NetBeans, the reason why Coslan create this software is he saw some hacker can easily stealing the user&apos;s password and it is more risks on their account and now they can&apos;t possibly take back the account. So, Coslan decide to create it. Sometimes, Coslan encounter diffculty in programming and have to go the website to search for information or ask Claude.ai for help, please sympathize, he is not a vibe coding." noResource="true"/>
